{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch-sonnet5/runs/eval-INC-86-r2-holdout/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "INC-86  Dangerous-goods check lets explosives sit next to oxidisers\nstatus: open   priority: P1   area: stowage   reported: 2026-08-14 by stowage-planning\n\nA class 1 container was planned directly beside an oxidiser and the stowage check raised\nnothing. It looks like any hazard class written with a division, such as oxidisers or\norganic peroxides, is never matched against the segregation table.\n\nAcceptance:\n  mustSegregate(\"1\", \"5.1\"), mustSegregate(\"5.1\", \"1\"), mustSegregate(\"2.1\", \"5.1\") and\n  mustSegregate(\"5.2\", \"3\") are all true; mustSegregate(\"3\", \"8\") and mustSegregate(\"8\",\n  \"5.1\") stay false; adjacentConflicts reports such pairs.\n\nFiles:\n  src/cargo/hazmat.ts", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_01GAubKSyTkwoJTRFbCsK5Gj", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "a0f33ff2-530a-4a9b-b3da-74b1e790b338", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:48:24.484Z", "toolUseResult": {"stdout": "INC-86  Dangerous-goods check lets explosives sit next to oxidisers\nstatus: open   priority: P1   area: stowage   reported: 2026-08-14 by stowage-planning\n\nA class 1 container was planned directly beside an oxidiser and the stowage check raised\nnothing. It looks like any hazard class written with a division, such as oxidisers or\norganic peroxides, is never matched against the segregation table.\n\nAcceptance:\n  mustSegregate(\"1\", \"5.1\"), mustSegregate(\"5.1\", \"1\"), mustSegregate(\"2.1\", \"5.1\") and\n  mustSegregate(\"5.2\", \"3\") are all true; mustSegregate(\"3\", \"8\") and mustSegregate(\"8\",\n  \"5.1\") stay false; adjacentConflicts reports such pairs.\n\nFiles:\n  src/cargo/hazmat.ts"}, "type": "user"}
